    "Name": "Mercury",
    "Details": "The MCY-100P is an early prototype of what would become the Mercury II, but before it's tonnage was increased. Using an 180 XL engine and MASC, it is even faster than the MCY-99 while keeping the 3.5 tons of ferro-fibrous armor. Using double heat sinks improved the cooling enough to change the weapons to one Medium Laser and a Center Torso mounted Extended Range Large Laser.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Modular Weapons</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.97</color></b>",
